msgid "Cloudflare's tunnel client - formerly known as Argo Tunnel, free intranet penetration, enabling external network access to intranet services"
msgstr “Cloudflare的隧道用戶端 - 以前稱為 Argo Tunnel ，免費的內網穿透，實現內網服務的外網訪問”

msgid "Enable"
msgstr “開啟”

msgid "Custom CMD"
msgstr “自定義啟動參數”

msgid "Use custom commands. If you don't understand, don't enable it."
msgstr “使用自定義的啟動參數，若不懂請勿開啟。”

msgid "Auto update"
msgstr “自動更新”

msgid "If now version is older, Please enable auto update."
msgstr “如果現在的版本較舊，請啟用自動更新。”

msgid "cloudflared program path"
msgstr “cloudflared程序路徑”

msgid "Customize the cloudflared storage path and make sure to fill in the complete path and cloudflared name."
msgstr “自定義cloudflared的存放路徑，確保填寫完整的路徑及cloudflared名稱。”

msgid "Token"
msgstr “隧道 Token”

msgid “You need to go to the official website to create a tunnel first， <br>and then copy a long string of token values starting with eyJh.<br> Be careful to copy correctly， otherwise the startup will fail.<br>You can also create a tunnel using the following command ：<a href='https://blog.outv.im/2021/cloudflared-tunnel/' target='_blank'>Tutorial-1</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href='https：//zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/621870045' target='_blank'>Tutorial-2</a>“
msgstr “需要先去官網創建隧道，再複製以eyJh開頭的一長串token值，注意複製正確否則會啟動失敗<br>關於沒有信用卡可以使用命令創建隧道 ：<a href='https：//blog.outv.im/2021/cloudflared-tunnel/' target='_blank'>教程1</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href='https：//zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/621870045' target='_blank'>教程2</a>”

msgid "Region"
msgstr “線路選擇”

msgid "Allows you to choose the regions to which connections are established. Currently the only available value is , which routes all connections through data centers in the United States. Default auto"
msgstr “目前只能選擇美國線路us。 默認為：auto”

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr “傳輸協定”

msgid "Specifies the protocol used to establish a connection between and the Cloudflare global network. Default auto"
msgstr 「傳輸協議選擇」。 默認為：auto”

msgid "Custom startup parameters"
msgstr “自定義啟動參數”

msgid "There is no need to add the program path here, just add the startup parameters normally. <br>Detailed command startup parameters:<a href='https://developers.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-one/connections/connect-networks/configure-tunnels/ tunnel-run-parameters/' target='_blank'>cloudflared doc</a><br>Note: Each parameter must be added separately, for example, add the first parameter:tunnel <br> Second parameter:--no-autoupdate The third parameter--logfile /tmp/cloudflared.info The fourth parameter:run <br>You cannot add two parameters in one box, you can only click + input in multiple input boxes<br>If you need to output the log path, please set it: --logfile /tmp/cloudflared.info"
msgstr “這裡不需要再加程序路徑，只需要正常添加啟動參數即可，詳細的命令啟動參數：<a href='https：//developers.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-one/connections/connect-networks/configure-tunnels/ tunnel-run-parameters/' target='_blank'>cloudflared文檔</a><br>注意：每個參數必須單獨添加，如添加第一個參數tunnel 第二個參數--no-autoupdate 第三個參數--logfile /tmp/cloudflared.info 第四個參數run <br>一個框內不能添加兩個參數，多個參數點+多個框即可<br>如需輸出日誌路徑請設置 --logfile /tmp/cloudflared.info”

msgid "Log level"
msgstr “日誌等級”

msgid "Specifies the verbosity of logging. The default info level doesn't produce much output, <br>but you may want to issue a warning when using this level in production.<br>Level from low to high：debug < info < warn < Error < Fatal"
msgstr 「指定日誌記錄的詳細程度。 默認info級別不會產生太多輸出，但您可能希望warn在生產中使用該級別。 <br>等級由低到高：debug < info < warn < Error < Fatal”

